+--!strict
+-- The ruinplate helm (the Ruinplate gown's headpiece): a fitted pale stone
+-- bascinet under a bronze circlet crowned with five tall points, a bronze brow
+-- band, nasal and face frame, and a moss-green wimple over the sides and back
+-- of the head. It climbs above the head and never widens at the ear, so the
+-- shape stays a crown over cloth, not a helmet.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local stone = { 156, 152, 140 }
+local stoneLit = { 184, 180, 166 }
